k:#E1E4E8\"> w1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fragments.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          y,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          bary: [w0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> area, w1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> area, w2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> area],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fragments;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码演示了软光栅化中的基本三角形遍历。实际 GPU 使用 Tile-Based 遍历和层次化测试加速这一过程，以 8×8 或 16×16 的块为单位批量测试，大幅减少逐像素计算量。</p>\n<p>重心坐标（Barycentric Coordinates）不仅用于内外判定，还用于对顶点属性进行插值。片段的任何属性值都可以通过三个顶点值的重心加权得到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度测试与-early-z-优化\">深度测试与 Early-Z 优化</h2><p>深度测试（Depth Test）是确定片段可见性的核心机制。每个片段都有一个深度值，与深度缓冲中已有的值比较，决定是否更新颜色缓冲。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[片段生成] --&gt; B{Early-Z 启用?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[Early-Z 测试]&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| D[片段着色器]&#10;    C --&gt;|失败| E[丢弃片段]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D&#10;    D --&gt; F[Late-Z 测试]&#10;    F --&gt;|通过| G[写入帧缓冲]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| E\">graph TD\n    A[片段生成] --&gt; B{Early-Z 启用?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[Early-Z 测试]\n    C --&gt;|通过| D[片段着色器]\n    C --&gt;|失败| E[丢弃片段]\n    B --&gt;|否| D\n    D --&gt; F[Late-Z 测试]\n    F --&gt;|通过| G[写入帧缓冲]\n    F --&gt;|失败| E</pre><p>Early-Z 是一项关键优化：在片段着色器执行前进行深度测试，提前丢弃不可见的片段，避免无效的着色计算。但以下情况会导致 Early-Z 失效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效原因</th>\n<th>具体操作</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动写入深度</td>\n<td><code>gl_FragDepth = ...</code></td>\n<td>使用 <code>layout(depth_greater)</code> 限定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alpha Test / discard</td>\n<td><code>if (alpha &lt; 0.5) discard;</code></td>\n<td>Alpha-to-Coverage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无序半透明</td>\n<td>关闭深度写入的混合</td>\n<td>OIT 技术</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>为了最大化 Early-Z 的收益，应当从前向后（Front-to-Back）排序不透明物体。距离相机最近的物体先绘制，其深度值写入深度缓冲后，后续被遮挡的物体在 Early-Z 阶段直接被丢弃。</p>\n<p>预深度 Pass（Depth Pre-pass / Z-Prepass）是另一种常用优化：先用极简着色器只写入深度缓冲，不做任何颜色计算；随后在正式渲染 Pass 中使用 <code>depthCompare: &#39;equal&#39;</code>，只对恰好可见的片段执行复杂着色。这在片段着色器非常昂贵的场景（如 PBR 光照）下效果显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"片段着色器与纹理采样\">片段着色器与纹理采样</h2><p>片段着色器是逐片段执行的可编程阶段，负责计算最终的颜色输出。它接收光栅化阶段插值后的顶点属性，执行纹理采样、光照计算、法线映射等操作。</p>\n<p>纹理采样是片段着色器中最常用的操作。GPU 的纹理单元（Texture Unit）提供硬件加速的采样和过滤功能：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤模式</th>\n<th>采样方式</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最近邻</td>\n<td>取最近像素</td>\n<td>锯齿明显</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双线性</td>\n<td>2×2 邻域加权</td>\n<td>平滑</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三线性</td>\n<td>双线性 + Mipmap 插值</td>\n<td>更平滑</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各向异性</td>\n<td>沿纹理梯度方向多次采样</td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Mipmap 是预计算的纹理分辨率金字塔，GPU 根据片段覆盖的纹理区域面积自动选择合适的 Mipmap 等级。这既减少了纹理走样，也提高了纹理缓存命中率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D roughnessMetallicMap;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;&#10;layout(location = 1) in vec3 fragNormal;&#10;layout(location = 2) in vec2 fragTexCoord;&#10;layout(location = 3) in mat3 fragTBN;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;&#10;&#10;layout(set = 1, binding = 0) uniform LightData {&#10;    vec3 lightDir;&#10;    vec3 lightColor;&#10;    vec3 cameraPos;&#10;};&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;&#10;    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;&#10;    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);&#10;    vec2 rm = texture(roughnessMetallicMap, fragTexCoord).rg;&#10;&#10;    vec3 L = normalize(-lightDir);&#10;    vec3 V = normalize(cameraPos - fragWorldPos);&#10;    vec3 H = normalize(L + V);&#10;&#10;    float NdotL = max(dot(N, L), 0.0);&#10;    float NdotH = max(dot(N, H), 0.0);&#10;&#10;    vec3 diffuse = albedo * NdotL * lightColor;&#10;    float spec = pow(NdotH, mix(8.0, 256.0, 1.0 - rm.r));&#10;    vec3 specular = lightColor * spec * rm.g;&#10;&#10;    outColor = vec4(diffuse + specular, 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D roughnessMetallicMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) in vec3 fragNormal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) in vec2 fragTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 3) in mat3 fragTBN;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 1, binding = 0) uniform LightData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 lightDir;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 lightColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 cameraPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec2 rm = texture(roughnessMetallicMap, fragTexCoord).rg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 L = normalize(-lightDir);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 V = normalize(cameraPos - fragWorldPos);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 H = normalize(L + V);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float NdotL = max(dot(N, L), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float NdotH = max(dot(N, H), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 diffuse = albedo * NdotL * lightColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float spec = pow(NdotH, mix(8.0, 256.0, 1.0 - rm.r));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 specular = lightColor * spec * rm.g;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    outColor = vec4(diffuse + specular, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个片段着色器演示了法线贴图和简化 PBR 光照的结合使用。法线贴图中的切线空间法线通过 TBN 矩阵转换到世界空间后参与光照计算，使得低多边形模型也能呈现丰富的表面细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抗锯齿技术\">抗锯齿技术</h2><p>光栅化生成的图像本质上是离散采样的结果，不可避免地产生锯齿（Aliasing）。抗锯齿（Anti-Aliasing）技术通过不同方式减轻这一问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[抗锯齿技术] --&gt; B[硬件多采样]&#10;    A --&gt; C[后处理抗锯齿]&#10;    A --&gt; D[时间抗锯齿]&#10;    B --&gt; E[MSAA 4x/8x]&#10;    C --&gt; F[FXAA]&#10;    C --&gt; G[SMAA]&#10;    D --&gt; H[TAA]&#10;    D --&gt; I[DLAA]\">graph TD\n    A[抗锯齿技术] --&gt; B[硬件多采样]\n    A --&gt; C[后处理抗锯齿]\n    A --&gt; D[时间抗锯齿]\n    B --&gt; E[MSAA 4x/8x]\n    C --&gt; F[FXAA]\n    C --&gt; G[SMAA]\n    D --&gt; H[TAA]\n    D --&gt; I[DLAA]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MSAA</td>\n<td>多重采样覆盖率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>显存和带宽增加</td>\n<td>前向渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FXAA</td>\n<td>边缘检测 + 模糊</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>性能敏感场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMAA</td>\n<td>形态学边缘检测</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TAA</td>\n<td>时间累积抖动采样</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>延迟渲染管线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MSAA（Multi-Sample Anti-Aliasing）在光栅化阶段对每个像素生成多个采样点，但只执行一次片段着色器。覆盖率信息决定了采样点的颜色混合比例。在 WebGPU 中启用 MSAA：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const msaaTexture = device.createTexture({&#10;  size: [canvas.width, canvas.height],&#10;  format: presentationFormat,&#10;  sampleCount: 4,&#10;  usage: GPUTextureUsage.RENDER_ATTACHMENT,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const renderPassDescriptor: GPURenderPassDescriptor = {&#10;  colorAttachments: [&#10;    {&#10;      view: msaaTexture.createView(),&#10;      resolveTarget: context.getCurrentTexture().createView(),&#10;      loadOp: &#39;clear&#39;,&#10;      storeOp: &#39;discard&#39;,&#10;      clearValue: { r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1 },&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> msaaTexture</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  size: [canvas.width, canvas.height],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format: presentationFormat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampleCount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usage: GPUTextureUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RENDER_ATTACHMENT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> renderPassDescriptor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPURenderPassDescriptor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  colorAttachments: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      view: msaaTexture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      resolveTarget: context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrentTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      loadOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      storeOp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      clearValue: { r: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, g: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TAA（Temporal Anti-Aliasing）已成为现代游戏引擎的主流选择。它通过在连续帧之间应用亚像素级抖动（Jitter），并将历史帧与当前帧进行指数加权混合，实现超采样效果。TAA 的关键挑战在于运动向量的准确性和 Ghosting 伪影的抑制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((光栅化与片段))&#10;    光栅化&#10;      边方程&#10;      重心坐标&#10;      Tile-Based 遍历&#10;    深度测试&#10;      Early-Z 优化&#10;      Z-Prepass&#10;      前向后排序&#10;    片段着色器&#10;      纹理采样&#10;      法线贴图&#10;      Mipmap 过滤&#10;    抗锯齿&#10;      MSAA&#10;      FXAA / SMAA&#10;      TAA 时间累积\">mindmap\n  root((光栅化与片段))\n    光栅化\n      边方程\n      重心坐标\n      Tile-Based 遍历\n    深度测试\n      Early-Z 优化\n      Z-Prepass\n      前向后排序\n    片段着色器\n      纹理采样\n      法线贴图\n      Mipmap 过滤\n    抗锯齿\n      MSAA\n      FXAA / SMAA\n      TAA 时间累积</pre><ul>\n<li>光栅化通过边方程将三角形转化为离散片段，重心坐标用于属性插值</li>\n<li>Early-Z 优化可在片段着色前丢弃不可见片段，前向后排序和 Z-Prepass 是关键策略</li>\n<li>片段着色器执行纹理采样和光照计算，法线贴图通过 TBN 矩阵实现切线空间变换</li>\n<li>Mipmap 和各向异性过滤平衡纹理质量与性能</li>\n<li>抗锯齿技术从硬件 MSAA 发展到后处理 FXAA/SMAA，TAA 已成为现代引擎的标配</li>\n<li>光栅化阶段的优化核心是尽早丢弃不可见片段，减少片段着色器的执行次数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光栅化与片段处理","id":"光栅化与片段处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"光栅化算法与边方程","id":"光栅化算法与边方程"},{"level":2,"text":"深度测试与 Early-Z 优化","id":"深度测试与-early-z-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"片段着色器与纹理采样","id":"片段着色器与纹理采样"},{"level":2,"text":"抗锯齿技术","id":"抗锯齿技术"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"顶点处理与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/vertex-processing"},"next":{"title":"延迟渲染与前向渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/deferred-vs-forward"}}